  "scientific_review": [
    "All ten declared fixed-longitude sections at both January15/July15,2022 00Z dates remain as twenty original cases. Native u/v and fixed90degree components,coordinates,indices,hyperslabs,timestamps,null support,candidate integral scores/local peaks and selected5/10/20cm/s layers are exact retained cloud artifacts. No unsuccessful,edge or primary-censored case is omitted.",
